    </title>
    <updated>2026-11-18T08:37:36Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72191505?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>farisbasha</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/farisbasha</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;docs: fix the dead SPDX download location links

The git resolver docs link the SPDX &amp;quot;Package download location&amp;quot; field
at spdx.github.io/spdx-spec/package-information/, which now returns
404 because the spec site is versioned. Point both links to the same
section of the SPDX 2.3.1 spec, which keeps the
#77-package-download-location-field anchor.&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
